Holding the door has more to it now. Let go early and the ring rewinds instead of blanking, so you can see nothing was sent. Start again and it always starts from empty. Complete the hold and the ring closes into a solid disc, pauses, then opens back out, with two beats on your wrist instead of one. While the press reaches the server and the door starts moving, the ring turns slowly, so a long wait looks like waiting. The big finish only plays for a press that really was sent.
